  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to WB under the Monitoring, Evaluating and Following the Flow of Funds for Reconstruction (ME3F) - Pakistan@100</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a multi-year support to WB under the Pakistan@100 initiative to understand the impacts of the 2022 flood on communities and households, providing a comprehensive monitoring framework independent of the geographic, sectoral, or intervention-specific scope of individual projects. The ME3F is designed and proposes to set up an independent monitoring and evaluation process that can provide reliable information on the equity of resource use, the quality and resilience of infrastructure and housing reconstruction, and the transparency of resource use by monitoring leakages or inefficiencies in the flow of funds allocated for rehabilitation and reconstruction.</narrative>
  </description>
